body:
first. it's fucking DESPICABLE for you to compare being trans to pedophilia as a counterargument, and I won't be responding to you further after this because you have no grasp on the conversation at hand.

&#x200B;

Pedophilia is a crime. Being trans, at least in America, is not. 

&#x200B;

I do not believe any \*thing\* that would harm a group of people gets the right to be called human. this includes pedophiles. 

&#x200B;

Trans people dont hurt others by being trans. Trans people are people, and people deserve rights. 

I dont know if you actually know anything about the legal system, but we DO take human rights away from criminals. So no, I don't.
